case('T03','Persistent errors, action notices and accessibility','partial',['browser/T03_PERSISTENT_ERROR.png','controls/action-working.png','controls/action-completed.png','live/results.json'],'Chrome keyboard and notices pass. Full screen-reader announcement validation remains deferred.')
